  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ししゃの　たましいが　こだいの\nつるぎに　やどって　うまれたらしい。\nひとに　とりつき　いのちを　すう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "죽은 자의 혼이 고대의\n검에 깃들어 태어났다고 한다.\n사람에게 씌어 생명을 빨아들인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon naît quand l’âme d’un défunt prend\npossession d’une épée ancienne. Il s’accroche aux\nhumains pour absorber leur énergie vitale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon wird geboren, wenn die Seele eines\nVerstorbenen sich in einem Schwert festsetzt. Es heftet\nsich an Menschen und saugt deren Lebenskraft aus.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuentan que este Pokémon nace cuando el espíritu de\nun difunto toma posesión de una espada antigua.\nSe aferra a las personas y absorbe su energía.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sembra sia nato quando uno spirito si impossessò\ndi un’antica spada. Si lega agli esseri umani per\nassorbirne la forza vitale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Apparently this Pokémon is born when a\ndeparted spirit inhabits a sword. It attaches itself\nto people and drinks their life force.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "死者の　魂が　古代の　剣に\n宿って　生まれたらしい。\n人に　とりつき　命を　吸う。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuentan que este Pokémon nace cuando el espíritu de\nun difunto toma posesión de una espada antigua.\nSe aferra a las personas y absorbe su energía.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "つるぎの　つかを　にぎった　ひとの\nうでに　あおい　ぬのを　まきつけて\nたおれるまで　いのちを　すいとる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "검의 자루를 잡은 사람의\n팔에 파란 천을 감아서\n쓰러질 때까지 목숨을 빨아들인다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si quelqu’un s’aventure à l’empoigner, il enroule son\nétoffe bleue autour du bras de l’infortuné et aspire\nson énergie vitale jusqu’à ce que ce dernier s’écroule.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wickelt ein blaues Tuch um den Arm von Menschen,\ndie seinen Schwertgriff ergreifen, und absorbiert deren\nLebensenergie, bis sie zusammenbrechen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si alguien osa empuñarlo, se enrolla en el brazo del\ndesafortunado con su paño azul y le absorbe toda la\nenergía hasta que pierde el sentido.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Avvolge il drappo blu attorno al braccio di chiunque\nsi azzardi a impugnarne l’elsa e assorbe la sua energia\nfino a fargli perdere i sensi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "If anyone dares to grab its hilt, it wraps\na blue cloth around that person’s arm and\ndrains that person’s life energy completely.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
